# Rust
/target/
**/target/
# Machine-specific cargo settings (.cargo/config.toml includes them); in the master
# they name the refusing rustc wrapper (`node scripts/work-folders.mjs guard-master`)
/.cargo/config.local.toml
/.cargo/master-guard.cmd
# Node
node_modules/
ui/dist/
dist/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
# Tauri
app/src-tauri/gen/
# Misc
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code local settings (machine-specific, e.g. autoMemoryDirectory)
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.nail-build/
# Copies of built releases (`NAIL_RELEASES_DIR=releases`, ADR 0218)
/releases/
# Your local setup for Claude Code (paths, remotes; ADRs 0199, 0234), never committed
/CLAUDE.local.md
# Personal notes for Claude Code, e.g. the lead's running status (.claude/local/next-steps.md); never committed
/.claude/local/
